I will bless Your name forever and ever.

text:
A Psalm of praise. Of David.
I will exalt You, my God and King;
I will bless Your name forever and ever.

segments.text:
My mouth will declare the praise of the LORD;
let every creature bless His holy name
forever and ever.

text:
